{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02VV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X' \\to X$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-pullback}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-faithful}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:37a54189ce237737aa882921946715e54a622d87196411876233f2686052bfeb", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a5829188638ade3359f9b58ceb2634e1a0e79f6cbcea1825342dc8c54787d934", "source_text": "In the situation of Lemma <REF_0001>\nassume that <MATH_0001> is surjective\nand flat. Then the pullback functor is faithful.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:26457d2df099df30e3a00fde904fa95856bcf056ab7392e09d65a03b4c5c360a", "unit_id": "tag:0240:statement"}
