{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "02VV", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:aeb4233d5212cb6dc6d3bc9e610437d8c289341a266e07f4ccb79de4adf76a7e", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe following two lemmas have been obsoleted by the improved\nexposition of the previous material. But they are still true!\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3f14986aeee1426b6ac0097aa2fd76e8f74c80646ff6637eefbce735e7a2ffb4", "unit_id": "tag:02VV:prose-0003"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02VV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f : X \\to X$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$S$", "MATH_0005": "$f$", "MATH_0006": "$X \\to S$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-pullback-selfmap}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:1808942ea179101705d9e10a0697c122603848432453a9c1859158da9582360d", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:fcb20c26c64f75ab075721f1dbb6b2b9d0a82edb719c99388da669b0b8a0a1a5", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a selfmap of <MATH_0003> over <MATH_0004>.\nIn this case pullback by <MATH_0005> is isomorphic to the\nidentity functor on the category of descent data\nrelative to <MATH_0006>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:cf507cd370f9a0cde0f3aae2be92d2928a259274f9b43b9de806217e844c1f67", "unit_id": "tag:0242:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02VV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f^* \\cong \\text{id}^*$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-pullback}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8e65095709f139803cf12dfd46965271b53779dd2846020f517126ebbaf50888", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c4cf1f25f8177df7f9d9fc58707b54d535a1c4c33f7b9a03084930e809ce1326", "source_text": "This is clear from Lemma <REF_0001> since it tells us that\n<MATH_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b08e129e536f93a904fd8c339b421d5f70473ee353023022b738cf6d86c313ff", "unit_id": "tag:0242:proof"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02VV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X' \\to X$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$g : X \\to X'$", "MATH_0004": "$S$", "MATH_0005": "$f$", "MATH_0006": "$X/S$", "MATH_0007": "$X'/S$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-pullback}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-morphism-with-section-equivalence}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:309200e4b24727dc3ea143b581acd702c66161c6e13f3cc80f742136e376fff5", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2d494691f6d862e52f30ff556957afc328819c399e7d961a45bae56d3ec91808", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes over a base scheme <MATH_0002>.\nAssume there exists a morphism <MATH_0003> over <MATH_0004>, for example\nif <MATH_0005> has a section. Then the pullback functor\nof Lemma <REF_0001> defines an equivalence of\ncategories between the category of descent data relative to\n<MATH_0006> and <MATH_0007>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9f7310b30a06be9fd04bdbf1ade8d7ec20c2c51d96d6ae7bcae621e617b19ce2", "unit_id": "tag:0243:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02VV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$g : X \\to X'$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$f^* \\circ g^* = (g \\circ f)^*$", "MATH_0004": "$g^* \\circ f^* = (f \\circ g)^*$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-pullback-selfmap}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c8fee073c55b495981aa8ab1b61b047cf4dfd7f2b667009bb47df8619ba3f983", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4084ff0eb784ee5a761261130e4a63d565fe5ae0259e20617c5a3d6011086b06", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism over <MATH_0002>.\nLemma <REF_0001> above shows that the functors\n<MATH_0003> and <MATH_0004>\nare isomorphic\nto the respective identity functors as desired.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2bca74a76db1d2ffa58344ee05272a399a81b940a2bc9f00daaeafc82b871fb9", "unit_id": "tag:0243:proof"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02VV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to X'$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$X \\to S$", "MATH_0004": "$X'/S$", "MATH_0005": "$X/S$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-pullback}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-morphism-source-faithfully-flat}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:079ce3adcb300d283fa58f23f7a9df3ba55ad6c7e27a4d7800b1fe3b0aaaf97f", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3fd7ca8a4fd82ec4ddebfe607febbe4915677f639be7c4ce498713b2e671c74a", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes over a base scheme <MATH_0002>.\nAssume <MATH_0003> is surjective and flat. Then the pullback functor\nof Lemma <REF_0001> is a faithful functor\nfrom the category of descent data relative to <MATH_0004> to the\ncategory of descent data relative to <MATH_0005>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c9fb08cb36dca31d0373c3f238ea6bc8581140e22941eb998bfe763acb302395", "unit_id": "tag:040J:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02VV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X \\to X'$", "MATH_0002": "$X \\to X \\times_S X' \\to X'$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-morphism-with-section-equivalence}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-faithful}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8fbbc8b6adb591a6c4d917d75247e1e9a75b1373af548cef27ad52c31aca1f62", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:586e7a396a456d39aa2a4804541a1e560e37744fc169edf749d45fbd2e8054ff", "source_text": "We may factor <MATH_0001> as <MATH_0002>.\nThe first morphism has a section, hence induces an equivalence of\ncategories of descent data by\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nThe second morphism is surjective and flat, hence induces a\nfaithful functor by Lemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:bec3c8c401e3497f96829bd936711ddccecf4ae4388b1dcf10f3dad4676fc71d", "unit_id": "tag:040J:proof"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02VV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to X'$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$\\{X \\to S\\}$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$X'/S$", "MATH_0006": "$X/S$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-pullback}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-morphism-source-fpqc-covering}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4ed4a595e4459266dc441f417db633898d8cc85ea3499f8e80265365edd571a6", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:54497ab465a18846412afed53ab7576e841db39ac927276598006490a72c6538", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes over a base scheme <MATH_0002>.\nAssume <MATH_0003> is an fpqc covering (for example if <MATH_0004> is\nsurjective, flat and quasi-compact).\nThen the pullback functor of Lemma <REF_0001> is a\nfully faithful functor from the category of descent data relative\nto <MATH_0005> to the category of descent data relative to <MATH_0006>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7ac8425d35ddad29abdea4560fc817cd844e32b8c597d570781a2ce0eab84797", "unit_id": "tag:040K:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02VV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X \\to X'$", "MATH_0002": "$X \\to X \\times_S X' \\to X'$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-morphism-with-section-equivalence}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-fully-faithful}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8fbbc8b6adb591a6c4d917d75247e1e9a75b1373af548cef27ad52c31aca1f62", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6497a261e920bcd9306d11f66a1729cf13cb282223d0de3ab8d5edb526f69218", "source_text": "We may factor <MATH_0001> as <MATH_0002>.\nThe first morphism has a section, hence induces an equivalence of\ncategories of descent data by\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nThe second morphism is an fpqc covering\nhence induces a fully faithful functor by Lemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8cddb151f94d751a242a8e93b33077380015aa9ea9e14a052c9220107b4c3067", "unit_id": "tag:040K:proof"}
